{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":" \n こんばちは\n \n \n 私はハマりやすいし影響されやすいです。\n \n 今は自分のことをゴミだと思っている\n フォーキーが大好きです🥺🥺\n トイストーリー4、とってもお勧めです、、。\n \n \n 佐々木久美です。\n \n 今日はパシフィコ横浜で\n 8th「黒い羊」最後の握手会でした！\n 欅坂46さんと一緒なのも最後で\n なんだか実感のないまま終わってしまいました、、。\n \n もう一緒にならないと思うと\n 悲しいです、、。\n \n でも沢山写真撮りました💗\n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ34H1N5J4MKVV7ACD3QQDJS","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n りささんの生誕祭で\n お花を渡す役割をいただきました！\n 本当に嬉しかったです💗\n でもとっても緊張しました😭\n \n 重要な役割をくださり、\n ありがとうございました！\n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ34H2NAPXQV8J6EVY89DPJB","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ34H3PGXGC83X496G4M9P6W","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ34H4QJ5ZCEY3YVBY9RM1BW","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ34H5PW0K2M5HK3VK2BCJ5G","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n 花束を渡すと聞いた時のきくちゃんです。\n \n ①驚く\n ②喜ぶ\n ③喜びを噛み締めて泣く\n ④お礼をする\n \n 以上の流れです。\n お納めください。\n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ34H6QKR8TCRTH2B5BGT89X","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n もりねえと天ちゃん💗\n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ34H7N1KVK65CYNVR89KDGM","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ34H8YCKFK22EYVT9B3XZRK","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ34H9Z58J3EH50NVDD5KSDB","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n 親戚の集まりみたいになりました（笑）\n \n 天ちゃんときくちゃんは\n 10歳離れていました😭😭😭\n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ34HAWPGQT9QPJ1FYNGFGV8","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n 仲良くなりたかったから\n 嬉しいです。🦒\n \n \n \n \n そうです。\n この日は浴衣きました🎆\n \n 